# Credentials to share with Claude Code (and other local dev tools) for this project.
#
# Copy this file to secrets/credentials.env and fill in values there.
# secrets/credentials.env is git-ignored and is NOT loaded into any Docker container.
# Claude reads only the key names and never prints the values.
#
# One KEY=value per line. Group by service and add a comment saying what each is for.
# Use test / sandbox accounts only, never a real customer's login.

# --- Example: a test login for browser checks ---
# OMS_TEST_STAFF_EMAIL=
# OMS_TEST_STAFF_PASSWORD=

# --- Example: a third-party API (sandbox) ---
# SOME_SERVICE_API_KEY=
